# Documentation ownership (public)

Living site status belongs in the private site repository that deploys this
implementation. Do not copy proven-slice narratives, leftover lists, or a
specific private repository name into this repository.

| Change | Update |
| --- | --- |
| Boundary or promotion | `AGENTS.md`, `docs/public-private-separation.md` |
| Shipped module/role | `README.md`, `ansible/README.md` if a role changed |
| Storage architecture | `docs/persistent-storage.md` |
| Typed public API | variables / argument specs, examples, describing README |

Bad: name a private repo or paste live “current status” into this README.
Good: describe what this commit ships and how a generic site repo consumes it.
